# Monorepo architecture (constitution)

Before moving files, adding packages, or copying code between folders, read
`.cursor/skills/monorepo-architecture/SKILL.md`.

## Layers (do not blur)

| Package | Role |
|---------|------|
| `packages/shared` | Game truth: sim, schema, zod, AI — TS pure |
| `packages/client-core` | Client engine: Transport, ArenaController, input, updates API |
| `packages/client-gfx` | Procedural art: PALETTE, AssetRegistry, builders (no R3F) |
| `apps/mobile` · `apps/desktop` | Platform shell: UI, input adapters, WorldRenderer glue |
| `server/` | Authoritative Colyseus + REST + `/updates` |
| `client/` | **Landing only** — downloads + non-interactive showcase |

## Dependency rule

`apps` → `client-core` → `shared`. Never `shared` → apps. Never duplicate engine
files inside apps or `client/`.

## Quick rejects

- New `ArenaController.ts` / `LocalTransport.ts` outside `client-core`
- `GameSimulation` outside `shared`
- `@colyseus/sdk` import in `apps/*` or `client/`
- Game menus or user input in `client/` (showcase bots only)
- Geometry builders duplicated in apps — use `client-gfx`

